## HR Attrition Analysis — Presentation

## Overview

This folder contains the presentation materials summarising the findings of the HR Attrition Analysis project.

## Purpose

The presentation translates analytical findings into business insights that HR professionals and decision-makers 
can use to investigate employee retention challenges.

## Contents

The presentation covers:

Business problem and project objectives.
Dataset overview and analytical methodology.
Key employee attrition findings.
Statistical analysis and interpretation.
Business recommendations.
Project limitations.

## Tools
Presentation PDF
SQL and Python for supporting analysis.
Looker Studio for dashboard visualisation.

## Intended Audience

HR managers, business stakeholders, recruiters, and data analytics professionals.

## Deliverable

The final presentation will be provided in PDF format.

## Key Takeaway

The presentation demonstrates how employee data can be transformed into clear findings and actionable recommendations 
to support workforce retention decisions.
